# EVAL-ONLY witness W-R4 (never in a prompt or training file).
# Complementary N+P input pairs + folded-cascode summing stage + common-source output
# with Miller Cc + nulling Rz.
# NMOS pair M1a/M1b (tail M9) drains into the top folding nodes f1/f2 (PMOS sources M3a/M3b);
# PMOS pair M2a/M2b (tail M10) drains into the bottom folding nodes g1/g2 (NMOS mirror
# M6a/M6b, gated by the diode-side cascode drain c1). Cascodes M4a/M4b (PMOS, gate vbp)
# and M5a/M5b (NMOS, gate = IREF net) sum both pairs' signal currents into o1.
# VINP is on the output side of both pairs (o1 inverting from VINP); the PMOS CS M14
# (gate o1, sink M15) inverts back.
# Bias (all from the one IREF): Rb lifts the NMOS cascode gate (= IREF net) above the
# mirror gate n1; M13 copies the reference into the PMOS diode M12 (gate pa = PMOS
# current-source and PMOS-tail gate); Rp drops the PMOS cascode gate vbp below pa.
NMOS M1a f1 VINN tn
NMOS M1b f2 VINP tn
PMOS M2a g1 VINN tp
PMOS M2b g2 VINP tp
NMOS M9 tn n1 VSS
PMOS M10 tp pa VDD
PMOS M3a f1 pa VDD
PMOS M3b f2 pa VDD
PMOS M4a c1 vbp f1
PMOS M4b o1 vbp f2
NMOS M5a c1 IREF g1
NMOS M5b o1 IREF g2
NMOS M6a g1 c1 VSS
NMOS M6b g2 c1 VSS
NMOS M11 n1 n1 VSS
R Rb IREF n1
NMOS M13 vbp n1 VSS
R Rp pa vbp
PMOS M12 pa pa VDD
PMOS M14 VOUT o1 VDD
NMOS M15 VOUT n1 VSS
C Cc o1 nz
R Rz nz VOUT
